24 h cooldown, so it held only the borrowed 20 hUSD against a 20.2 hUSD balance (principal + 1% fee).
Recovered by hand inside the 10-minute demo term, then fixed in scripts/e2e-credit-v2.ts (it now
withdraws the fee shortfall from the wallet's own pool shares before repaying):
